<title>USA: Bradlees names Robert Lynn president.</title>
<headline>Bradlees names Robert Lynn president.</headline>
<dateline>BRAINTREE, Mass. 1997-04-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bradlees Inc said on Wednesday it named Robert Lynn president and chief merchandising officer.</p>
<p>Lynn will report to Peter Thorner, the former president, who succeeded Mark Cohen as chairman in December 1996 after Cohen resigned.</p>
<p>Lynn formerly was vice chairman and chief operating officer of American Eagle Outfitters Inc.</p>
<p>Bradlees is a discount retailer, with 109 stores in seven northeastern states.</p>
